{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your desktop in this idle auto-battler that sits quietly in the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off endless waves of enemies, upgrade your lone tower, and grow stronger across ascensions while you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778500/extras/ezgif-15dece86bc2dd2.gif?t=1760552080\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP, level up, and earn rewards such as permanent upgrades, powerful loot, or new weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop rare gear with huge bonuses. Equip the best and create broken builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and grow stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your run to earn Ascendium, unlocking cross-ascension upgrades that boost your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778500/extras/ezgif-1e92602846686d.gif?t=1760552080\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always on, never in the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs in a small corner of your screen so you can work, browse, or game while defending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust size and position to fit your setup. Stay passive or play actively. It's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo allows you to progress until level 10, and has a reduced pool of upgrades when compared to the full game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778500?t=1760552080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778500?t=1760552080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778500/9e5898fa33688213ee7eb9438d0cbf8056e15119/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760552080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778500/9e5898fa33688213ee7eb9438d0cbf8056e15119/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760552080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your desktop in this idle auto-battler that sits quietly in the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off endless waves of enemies, upgrade your lone tower, and grow stronger across ascensions while you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778500/extras/ezgif-15dece86bc2dd2.gif?t=1760552080\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP, level up, and earn rewards such as permanent upgrades, powerful loot, or new weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop rare gear with huge bonuses. Equip the best and create broken builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and grow stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your run to earn Ascendium, unlocking cross-ascension upgrades that boost your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778500/extras/ezgif-1e92602846686d.gif?t=1760552080\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always on, never in the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs in a small corner of your screen so you can work, browse, or game while defending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust size and position to fit your setup. Stay passive or play actively. It's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo allows you to progress until level 10, and has a reduced pool of upgrades when compared to the full game.</p>","developers":["Conradical Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3772810","name":"Desktop Defender"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778500/8aed2fe83acbf25b9ac04a778530a24e30c2c7c1/header.jpg?t=1760552080","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Desktop Defender 2025 \u00a9 Conradical S\u00e0rl","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3778500/1559796573/e30e7f8c1f90c71fa42bd6dd23e0b7475447fcd6/1750373743/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760348172","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3778500/1559796573/e30e7f8c1f90c71fa42bd6dd23e0b7475447fcd6/1750373743/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760348172","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3778500/1559796573/e30e7f8c1f90c71fa42bd6dd23e0b7475447fcd6/1750373743/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760348172","id":257146684,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146684/movie480.mp4?t=1760348172","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146684/movie_max.mp4?t=1760348172"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146684/2c4e55f32d605e469fe8dcd22dfba2bc3c79f77e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760348172","webm":{"480":"htt